<!DOCTYPE html>
<html style="overflow-y: hidden;">
<head>
	<title>Qantas Reimbursement Information</title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p><strong>Reference no:</strong> {{{Recovery__c.Parent_Case__c}}}</p>

<p><strong>Case submitted:</strong> {{{Recovery__c.Case_ReceivedDate__c}}}</p>

<p><strong>Reimbursement reason(s):</strong> {{{Recovery__c.Recovery_Reason__c}}}</p>

<p>{{{Recovery__c.Value__c}}}</p>

<hr />
<p>Hi {{{Case.Contact_First_Name__c}}},</p>

<p>Please refer to the previous correspondence regarding this claim.</p>

<h3>Your reimbursement amount</h3>

<p>You will receive a reimbursement of {{{Recovery__c.Value__c}}}. Payments made to bank accounts outside of Australia will be converted into the equivalent local currency at the time of payment.</p>

<h3>How to organise your reimbursement</h3>

<p>To process your reimbursement, you will need to provide us with your bank account details using our secure portal.</p>

<p>Here&#39;s how you can safely provide us with your bank details:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Visit <a href="http://www.qantas.com/updateyourcase">Update your case</a></li>
	<li>Log in securely using your customer care reference number and email address. This will be the same email address you used to create your claim.</li>
	<li>Provide your Australian or International bank details in our secure portal.</li>
	<li>Review the information and submit.</li>
</ul>

<p>You can track your reimbursement via the request tracker in the Qantas app or via email.</p>

<h3>Need Help?</h3>

<p>Call us on 13 13 13 (in Australia) or your local Qantas Office <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us.html">here</a> for assistance.</p>

<h3>If you&rsquo;re suspicious</h3>

<p>Not sure something is genuine? Remember, Qantas will never ask you to email details of your bank account, credit card, PIN, or passwords.</p>

<p>{{{Recovery__c.Terms_Conditions__c}}}</p>
</body>
</html>